## Use of YOLO and License Constraints
At its current stage, this pipeline relies on YOLO framework (Ultralytics) for object detection. YOLO is released
under the `GNU Affero General Public License (AGPL-3.0)`, which introduces specific obligations and
restrictions, particularly with respect to commercial use and deployment. Users intending to apply this pipeline in
commercial or production environments must ensure compliance with the YOLO license terms or obtain a
commercial license from Ultralytics.
